        "description": "TEHRAN \u2013 Ehud Olmert\u2019s recent article describing a \u201cviolent and criminal attempt at ethnic cleansing\u201d in the occupied West Bank reads less like a revelation than a confession delivered far too late. What makes his words notable is not that they uncover a hidden reality, but that they strip away the last remnants of plausible deniability from within Israel\u2019s own political establishment. Palestinians, human rights organizations, and international observers have documented these crimes for decades. Olmert\u2019s intervention matters only because it confirms that those at the very center of Israeli power have long known exactly what was happening.",
